["tocversion"] = 100002,
["id"] = "Fix TotemFrameTotem",
["desc"] = "The Dragonflight UI revamp has changed how the TotemFrame is working now. This means that macros such as `/click TotemFrame1 right 1` will no longer work, since these frames no longer exist.\n\nThis WeakAura recreates these frames, so existing macros will continue to work, since there is currently no other way that I'm aware of, to cancel \"Totems\" with macros.\n\nAfter you have imported this WeakAura, you can continue using macros such as these, to get rid of totems and other things\n\n/click TotemFrameTotem1 RightButton\n/click TotemFrameTotem2 RightButton\n/click TotemFrameTotem3 RightButton\n/click TotemFrameTotem4 RightButton\n\nSadly, there is no way to reference individual totems, as Blizzard removed this feature a long time ago.\n",
