["text"] = "Customize the marks utilized by WeakAura by enabling or disabling specific ones according to your preference. Notably, iconic marks such as |T137008:0|t or |T137007:0|t may already be applied by other addons. Additionally, you have the option to adjust the order of these marks by rearranging the numbers in the dropdown menu. This feature allows you to prioritize the sequence in which WeakAura applies marks, providing flexibility and control over your gaming experience.\n\n|cFFFF0000!|r Player Marks override the Enable / Disable",
